674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9eUYyzOAdFYQ7kNvwH7NoDA&_nc_oc=AdrdbHbyG8WjDX9dAabgw7z2qtcojy8OagGU1_uqhJ1w8-qZrFcEoB4Zfhg8LJkCESU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ4H8yPfkLqOIZ4Rnu2yN7KsI60MknGxkHuSjIMvf4AFg&oe=6AF8A919"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CvRCSdVK1IUQ7kNvwEgkk2V&_nc_oc=AdonKlNOI1ri7mhoB-dBGgZOt5pLLkKzKt4S1ICtiTbkoD9P19rkGVaauJSXLU703pY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSmQsqsubyPwEcNSgiG7IOpK-qUQUbLuYxVuzLW-GdnvA&oe=6AF87996"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h6f4JVJfBvgQ7kNvwFcgc0o&_nc_oc=AdohGLqbV_jJt-vA1H7g-R3n9jl89aSf-X45lXaOwQaCO3R9xnWG_hhkrRdiRZnoz54&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTFGfRX6p9OrPQETQ-Vr98XJgI5cXmF6vB08RjhyyiJRQ&oe=6AF875B1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip